  unitName: Brave Knight Karl
  unitId: 20233
  unitNumber: 334
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Karl, a Summoner belonging to the Akras
    Summoners' Hall. Head of the 24th Demon Slayers Division "Rebel Lance," also
    known as "Nyonne." Considered to be one of the strongest Demon Slayers regiments,
    Nyonne was often counted upon by the Summoners' Hall's upper echelon. Karl's
    strength was well known, and he became famous in Elgaia for vanquishing the Wicked
    Drake Zagamlung. It's also been rumored an old friend of his has been active
    lately as well.
  summonDesc: You have summoned me.<br>I always believed that<br>this day would come!
  fusionDesc: Fusion, eh? How wonderful!<br>I want to become even stronger<br>so
    I can be of assistance to you!
